<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Angel at Heart Charity</title>

<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
    }

    header {
        background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526256262350-7da7584cf5eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
        height: 70vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }

    header p {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        margin-top: 10px;
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }

    .section {
        padding: 60px 10%;
        background: white;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }

    h2 {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #c0392b;
    }

    .programs {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        text-align: center;
    }

    .donate-btn {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-top: 30px;
    }

    footer {
        background: #222;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-top: 40px;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div>
        <h1>Angel at Heart Charity</h1>
        <p>Be the Angel. Be the Impact. Be the Change.</p>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; text-align: center;">
        Angel at Heart Charity provides hot meals, emergency support, clothing, hygiene essentials, 
        and community outreach to families in need. We believe in compassion, power, and community.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>What We Provide</h2>

    <div class="programs">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>🍽 Hot Meals</h3>
            <p>Fresh, warm meals delivered to individuals and families facing food insecurity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🚨 Emergency Support</h3>
            <p>Immediate assistance when life hits hard — we show up with compassion and care.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🧼 Hygiene Essentials</h3>
            <p>We provide hygiene kits, clothing, and personal care items to restore dignity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🤝 Community Outreach</h3>
            <p>We uplift our community through hands-on support and heart-centered service.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Donate Today</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center; font-size:1.2rem;">
        Your generosity becomes a child’s next meal, a family’s breakthrough moment, and hope where it’s needed most.
    </p>

    <div class="donate-btn">
        <!-- REAL PAYPAL DONATE BUTTON -->
        <form action="https://www.paypal.com/donate" method="post" target="_blank">
